; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
;  $40-$43  the ground.  The line itself is the top row of the tile, so it
;           lands on y=192 exactly, which is where the dino's feet are and
;           where a cactus sits.  The variants differ only in the grit under
;           the line; the line is always flat, so a dino never has to follow
;           the terrain.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
@tile GROUND_A $40
oooooooo
........
........
........
........
........
........
........

@tile GROUND_B $41
oooooooo
........
........
........
........
........
........
